  "description": "Engine rigid-zone fields per engine record type (AGENTS.md principle 3, ADR-0079 item 5, contracts/blueprint-modules.md). These are the pinned engine's own valuation, costing, posting, tax and ledger fields. A Blueprint may not declare, override, rename, or set a default or options on any of them on an entity it binds through a module concept, on that entity's child_table rows, or through that entity's component parameters (validator BP-MOD-001). Internal only (ADR-0016): never shown to a customer. UNVERIFIED until a bench run on the pinned set confirms the names, in each module's component build: CRM BPL-056, projects BPL-057, manufacturing BPL-058, marketing BPL-059. Billing selectors count as posting fields: Timesheet Detail is_billable and the Timesheet and Project customer pick what goes onto a sales invoice (erpnext/projects/doctype/timesheet/timesheet.py at the tag), and the Timesheet currency and company are ledger fields. Stock-shaping fields count as posting fields (#397 review): Work Order skip_transfer, from_wip_warehouse and use_multi_level_bom, BOM transfer_material_against and is_default, and the subcontracting warehouses decide which materials move and from where (stock_entry.py at the tag).",
